WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.056
Run the sampled PID axis; change mass from 1 to 2 kg and target from 1 to 0.5 m.

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:23.176
Inspect continuous-time root locus, Bode and Nyquist views; toggle Nyquist zoom.

00:00:23.176 --> 00:00:34.297
Run the kinematic arm demonstration; zoom and watch tool coordinates.

00:00:34.297 --> 00:00:38.381
Start an empty diagram. Drag a Constant block from the library onto the canvas.

00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:47.502
Prepared model: Constant 3, Gain 2, Scope. Drag each OUT circle onto the next IN circle.

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:54.605
Run the connected model. The live scope confirms 3 times 2 equals 6.
